From 5f0a073d2e34b1bd63e1394915f85c04323988d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rpc: add Boost.Asio coroutines, O(1) GBT, and compact block
 templates

Port Boost.Asio C++20 coroutine HTTP/RPC dispatcher, AsyncBlockChangeWaiter
non-blocking long-poll suspension for waitfornewblock/waitforblock/waitforblockheight
and getblocktemplate, O(1) lock-free getblocktemplate + submitsealedheader
mining fast path (preserving 80-byte CBlockHeader and positional SHA-256d
Merkle root), 3-tier FeeHysteresisController, and elastic adaptive blocksize
ceiling (removing the 32 MB ceiling when -adaptiveblocksize=1).
